      "title": "Soviet epistemologies and the materialist ontology of poor life : Andrei Platonov, Alexander Bogdanov and Lev Vygotsky",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Maria Chehonadskih",
          "openalex_id": "A5075747004"
